sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant P as Proposer (aider)
    participant T as Tester
    participant N as neatlogs

    Note over O,T: Harness learning — test-time adaptation (arXiv:2609.35738 §4.2)
    O->>N: trace("antar-run", WORKFLOW)

    loop T rounds (revision budget ≤ 3)
        O->>P: x_t = { fix_summary, harness, execution_report }
        P->>P: propose candidate edit y_i (SEARCH/REPLACE)
        P->>O: Apply(h_{t-1}, y_i) → revised harness h'_i
        O->>T: run test_cmd on h'_i
        T->>T: score = fraction of tests passing (Eq. 3)
        T-->>O: ExecutionReport { score, failing traces, history }
        O->>N: span(revision_t) { score, returncode }

        alt tests pass (score = 1.0)
            O->>O: Select: retain h_t ✓
            Note over O: break — proceed to PR
        else tests fail
            O->>P: feed ExecutionReport back as x_{t+1}
            Note over O,P: diagnosis → targeted revision
        end
    end

    O->>N: log(harness_revision_done, success, revisions)
